cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite both the software and the accompanying manuscript."
title: "Mastitis detection in Murrah buffaloes from infrared thermography — analysis pipeline"
abstract: >-
  R pipeline for feature engineering, animal-aware splitting, isotonic
  probability calibration, and Random Forest / XGBoost classification of
  clinical mastitis (CM), subclinical mastitis (SCM), and any-mastitis
  states in Murrah buffaloes from udder-quarter infrared thermography.
